# Project Tech Stack

- Backend implementation must use Go.
- Do not introduce backend services or business logic in Node.js, Python, Java, or other server runtimes unless the user explicitly requests an exception.
- Frontend implementation must use React.
- For UI work, prefer React components, hooks, and React-based app structure; do not introduce Vue, Angular, or other frontend frameworks by default.
